<title>CHINA: Bear Stearns sets call warrants on HSBC.</title>
<headline>Bear Stearns sets call warrants on HSBC.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bear Stearns Companies Inc said on Thursday it had launched 28 million American-style call warrants on shares of HSBC Holdings Plc.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$292.95	PREMIUM	    16.80 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$3.2922	GEARING	    8.47x</p>
<p> LAUNCH DATE	 17.JUL.97	SETTLEMENT DATE  04.AUG.97</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  15.MAY.98	LISTING DATE     06.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	BOARD LOT	  4,000</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT    HK$279</p>
<p>	 -- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
